hadiths[82]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1987","[AI-translation] ´Umm ul-Momineen Zainab bint Jahsh raziyallahu anha se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam neend se us haal mein bedaar hue ke Aap farma rahay thay ((la ilaah illa Allah)) kharaabi hai Arab ki us aafat se jo qareeb hai aaj Yajooj aur Majooj ki aar itni khul gayi aur (rawi hadees) Sufyan ne das ka hindsa banaya (yani angoothay aur kalima ki ungli se halqa banaya) mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya ham us haal mein bhi tabah ho jayein ge jabke ham mein naik log maujood hun ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haan ! jab burayi zyada ho gi (yani fisq o fujoor ya zina ya aulad zina ya ma'aasi) "
"1988","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : aaj Yajooj aur Majooj ki aar ki deewar mein se itna khul gaya (yani us mein itna suraakh ho gaya) aur (rawi hadees) Wuhaib ne us ko ungliyon se noe ka hindsa bana kar bayan kiya (shayad ye hadees pehle ki ho aur Umm ul-Momineen Zainab raziyallahu anha ke baad ki aur shayad maqsood tamseel ho na ke had bayan ki gayi ho)"
"1989","[AI-translation] ´Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Madina ke mehalon mein se aik mehal (ya qila) par charhe phir farmaya : kiya jo kuch mein dekh raha hun tum bhi dekh rahay ho beshak mein tumharay gharon mein fitnon ki jagahein us tarah dekhta hun jaisay barish ke girnay ki jagahon ko "
"1990","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Umar raziyallahu anhu ke qareeb baithay hue thay ke unhon ne kaha : tum mein se kis ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko fitnon ka zikr kartay hue suna hai baaz logon ne kaha ke haan ! ham ne suna hai Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke shayad tum fitnon se wo fitnay samjhay ho jo aadmi ko us ke gharbaar aur maal aur hamsaye mein hotay hain unhon ne kaha ke haan Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke un fitnon ka kaffara to namaz rozay aur zakaat se ho jata hai lekin tum mein se un fitnon ke baaray mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kis ne suna hai jo darya ki maujon ki tarah umad kar aayein ge Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke log khamosh ho gaye mein ne kaha ke mein ne suna hai Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke to ne suna hai tera baap bohat acha tha (ye aik du'aaiya kalima hai jo Arab log istemaal kartay hain) Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke fitnay dilon par aik ke baad aik aik ke baad aik aisay aayein ge jaisay boriye ki tailiaan aik ke baad aik hoti hain phir jis dil mein fitna rach jaye ga us mein aik kala daagh paida ho ga aur jo dil us ko na manay ga to us mein aik safed nooraani dhabba ho ga yahan tak ke usi tarah kaalay aur safed dhabbay hotay hotay do qasam ke dil ho jayein ge aik to khaalis safed dil chuknay pathar ki tarah ke aasmaan o zameen ke qaim rehnay tak usay koi fitna nuqsan na pahunchaye ga doosray kala safedi maayil ya ultay koozay ki tarah jo na kisi achi baat ko achi samjhay ga na buri baat ko buri magar wohi jo us ke dil mein baith jaye Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir mein ne Umar raziyallahu anhu se hadees bayan ki ke tumharay aur us fitnay ke darmiyan mein aik band darwaza hai magar qareeb hai ke wo toot jaye Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tera baap na ho (ye bhi aik kalima hai jisay Arab aam taur par kisi kaam par mutanabbih karnay ya mustaed karnay ko kehtay hain) kiya wo toot jaye ga khul jata to shayad phir band ho jata mein ne kaha ke nahi toot jaye ga aur mein ne un se hadees bayan ki ke ye darwaza aik shakhs hai jo maara jaye ga ya mar jaye ga phir ye hadees koi ghalat (dil se banayi hui baat) na thi Abu Khaalid ne kaha ke mein ne Sa'eed bin Taariq se poocha ke ((” Aswad Mirbaada “)) se kiya muraad hai unhon ne kaha ke siyahi mein safedi ki shiddat mein ne kaha ke ((” Kaal Kooz Majkhiya “)) se kiya muraad hai unhon ne kaha ke aundha kiya hua kooza "
"1991","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Iblees apna takht pani par rakhta hai phir apne lashkaron ko duniya mein fasaad karnay ko bhejta hai pas sab se bara fitna baaz us ka sab se zyada qareebi hota hai koi shaitaan un mein se aa kar kehta hai ke mein ne falan falan kaam kiya (yani falan se chori karayi falan ko sharaab palwaayi waghera) to shaitaan kehta hai ke to ne kuch bhi nahi kiya phir koi aa kar kehta hai ke mein ne falan ko na chhora yahan tak ke us mein aur us ki biwi mein judai kara di to us ko apne qareeb kar leta hai aur kehta hai ke haan to ne bara kaam kiya hai A'mash ne kaha mera khayal hai ke us ko apne saath chimta leta hai "
"1992","[AI-translation] ´Abu Idrees Khaulani kehtay hain ke` Huzaifa bin Yamaan raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam mein sab logon se zyada har fitna ko janta hun jo mere darmiyan aur qayamat ke darmiyan honay wala hai aur ye baat nahi hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne chhupa kar koi baat khaas mujh se bayan ki ho jo auron se na ki ho lekin Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik majlis mein fitnon ka bayan kiya jis mein mein bhi tha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un fitnon ka shumaar kartay hue farmaya : teen un mein se aisay hain jo qareeb qareeb kuch na chhorein ge aur un mein se baaz garmi ki aandhion ki tarah hain baaz un mein chotay hain aur baaz baray hain Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke (ab) mere siwa us majlis ke sab log faut ho chukay hain aik mein baaqi hun (us wajah se ab mujh se zyada koi fitnon ka jannay wala baaqi na raha) "
"1993","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah ham mein (waz sunanay ko) kharay hue to koi baat na chhori jo us waqt se le kar qayamat tak honay wali thi magar us ko bayan kar diya phir yaad rakha jis ne rakha aur bhool gaya jo bhool gaya mere saathi us ko jantay hain aur baaz baat hoti hai jis ko mein bhool gaya tha phir jab mein us ko dekhta hun to yaad aa jaati hai jaisay aadmi doosray aadmi ki adam maujoodgi mein us ka chehra yaad rakhta hai phir jab us ko dekhay to pehchan leta hai "
"1994","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne har aik baat bata di jo qayamat tak honay wali thi aur koi baat aisi na rahi jis ko mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se na poocha ho albatta mein ne ye na poocha ke Madina walon ko Madina se kaun si cheez nikalay gi "
"1995","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zaid (yani Amr bin Akhtab) raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` hamein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Fajr ki namaz padhayi aur mimbar par charh kar hamein waz sunaya yahan tak ke Zohar ka waqt aa gaya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam utray aur namaz padhi phir mimbar par charhe aur hamein waz sunaya yahan tak ke Asr ka waqt aa gaya phir utray aur namaz padhi phir mimbar par charhe aur hamein waz sunaya yahan tak ke sooraj doob gaya pas jo kuch ho chuka hai aur jo kuch honay wala tha sab ki hamein khabar de di aur ham mein sab se zyada wo aalim hai jis ne sab se zyada un baaton ko yaad rakha ho "
"1996","[AI-translation] ´Muhammad (bin Sireen) kehtay hain ke` Jundub ne kaha ke mein ne yaum al-Jur'a (yani jis din Jur'a mein fasaad honay wala tha aur Jur'a Kufa mein aik muqaam hai jahan Kufa walay Sa'eed bin Aas se larnay ke liye jama hue thay jab Usman raziyallahu anhu ne un ko Kufa ka haakim bana kar bheja tha) ko aik shakhs ko baithay hue dekha to kaha ke aaj to yahan kai khoon hun ge wo shakhs bola ke hargiz nahi Allah ki qasam ! khoon na hun ge mein ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! khoon zaroor hun ge wo bola ke Allah ki qasam ! hargiz khoon na hun ge mein ne kaha Allah ki qasam ! zaroor qatl hun ge us ne kaha Allah ki qasam ! hargiz qatl na hun ge aur mein ne us baaray mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aik hadees suni hai jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se farmayi thi mein ne kaha ke to aaj mera bura saathi hai us liye ke to sunta hai mein tera khilaf kar raha hun aur to ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aik hadees suni hai aur mujhe mana nahi karta phir mein ne kaha ke us ghussay se kiya faida aur mein us shakhs ki taraf mutawajjah hua aur poocha to maloom hua ke wo Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) sahabi Rasool hain "
"1997","[AI-translation] ´Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai wo kehtay thay ke` Ae Iraq walo ! mein tum se chotay gunah nahi poochta na us ko poochta hun jo kabeera gunah karta ho mein ne apne walid Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se suna wo kehtay thay ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke fitna idhar se aaye ga aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne haath se mashriq ki taraf ishara kiya jahan shaitaan ke donon seeng nikaltay hain aur tum aik doosray ki gardan maartay ho (halanke momin ki gardan maarna kitna bara gunah hai) aur Musa alaihissalam Fir'aun ki qaum ka aik shakhs ghalati se maar baithay thay (na ba niyyat qatl kyunke ghonsay se aadmi nahi marta) to us par Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ” to ne aik khoon kiya phir ham ne tujhe gham se nijaat di aur tujh ko aazmaya jaisa aazmaya tha “ (Surah Taha : 40)"
"1998","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab Kisra (Iran ka baadshah) mar gaya to ab us ke baad koi Kisra na ho ga aur jab Qaisar (Room ka baadshah) mar jaye ga to us ke baad koi Qaisar na ho ga (aur ye donon mulk Musalman fatah kar lein ge) qasam us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai un donon ke khazanay Allah ki raah mein kharch kiye jayein ge "
"1999","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke albatta Musalmanon ya mominon ki (shak rawi) aik jamaat Kisra ke khazana ko khole gi jo safed mehal mein hai Qutaiba ki riwayat mein Musalmanon ki hai shak ke baghair "
"2000","[AI-translation] ´Sauban (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne mere liye zameen ko lapait diya (yani sab zameen ko lapait kar mere saamnay kar diya) to mein ne us ka mashriq o Maghrib dekha aur meri ummat ki hukumat wahan tak pahunche gi jahan tak zameen mujhe dikhayi gayi aur mujhe surkh aur safed do khazanay diye gaye (yani sona aur chaandi ya Qaisar o Kisra ke khazanay) aur mein ne apne Rab se dua ki ke meri ummat ko aam qaht se halaak na karna aur un par koi ghair dushman aisa ghalib na karna ke un ka jatha toot jaye aur un ki jar kat jaye (yani bilkul neest o naabood naabood ho jayein) mere Rab ne farmaya ke Ae Muhammad ! jab mein koi faisla kar deta hun phir wo nahi palatta aur mein ne teri ye duayein qabool kein aur teri ummat ko aam qaht se halaak na karun ga na un par koi ghair dushman jo un mein se na ho aisa ghalib karun ga ke jo un ki jar kaat de agarchay zameen ke tamam log (Musalmanon ko tabah karnay ke liye) ikathay ho jayein (magar un ko tabah na kar sakein ge) yahan tak ke khud Musalman aik doosray ko halaak karein ge aur aik doosray ko qaid karein ge "
"2001","[AI-translation] ´Amir bin Sa'd apne walid Sa'd raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kartay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik din Aaliya (Aaliya wo gaon hain jo Madina se bahar hain) se aaye hatta ke Bani Muawiya ki masjid par se guzray us mein gaye aur do rakatein padhein aur ham ne bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padhi aur apne Rab se bohat taweel dua ki phir hamaray paas aaye aur farmaya ke mein ne apne Rab se teen duayein maangein lekin us ne do duayein qabool kar lein aur aik qabool nahi ki mein ne apne Rab se ye dua ki ke meri ummat ko qaht se halaak na karay (yani saari ummat ko qaht se) to Allah Taala ne ye dua qabool ki aur mein ne ye dua ki ke meri (saari) ummat ko pani mein dubo kar halaak na karay to Allah Taala ne ye dua bhi qabool ki aur mein ne ye dua ki ke Musalman aapas mein aik doosray se na larein to us ko qabool nahi kiya "
"2002","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : albatta tum agli ummaton ki raahon (yani gunaahon mein aur deen ki mukhalifat mein na ye ke kufr ikhtiyar karo ge) par baalisht barabar baalisht aur haath barabar haath challu ge yahan tak ke agar wo goh ke suraakh mein ghuse thay to tum bhi ghuso ge ham ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! agli ummaton se muraad Yahudi aur Nasaara hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke (agar ye nahi to) aur kaun hain "
"2003","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : logon ko Quraish mein se ye khaandaan halaak karay ga sahaba ne kaha ke phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamein kiya hukm detay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar log un se alag rahein to behtar hai "
"2004","[AI-translation] ´Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak kai fitnay hun ge khabardaar raho ! kai fitnay hun ge un mein baithnay wala chalnay walay (logon) se behtar ho ga aur bhaagnay walay (logon) se chalnay wala behtar ho ga khabardaar raho ! jab fitna aur fasaad utray ya waaqe ho to jis ke oont hun wo apne oonton mein ja milay aur jis ki bakriyan hun wo apni bakriyon mein ja milay aur jis ki (khaiti ki) zameen ho wo apni zameen mein ja rahay aik shakhs ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! jis ke na oont hun aur na bakriyan aur na zameen ho wo kiya karay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo apni talwaar uthaye aur pathar se us ki baarh ko kot daalay (yani larnay ki koi cheez baaqi na rakhay jo larai ka hausla ho) phir apni istitaat ke mutaabiq bachao aur nijaat ka rasta ikhtiyar karay ilaahi kiya mein ne tera hukm pahuncha diya ilaahi kiya mein ne tera hukm pahuncha diya ilaahi kiya mein ne tera hukm pahuncha diya aik shakhs bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! batlaiye ke agar mujh par zabardasti ki jaye yahan tak ke mujhe do safon mein se ya do girohon mein se aik le jayein phir wahan koi mujhe talwaar maaray ya teer aaye aur mujhe qatl kar de Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo apna aur tera gunah samait le ga aur dozakh mein jaye ga "
"2005","[AI-translation] ´Ahnaf bin Qais kehtay hain ke` mein us irada se nikla ke us shakhs ka shareek hun ga (yani Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ka Muawiya raziyallahu anhu ke muqaabile mein shareek hun ga) raah mein mujh se Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) milay aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Ahnaf tum kahan jatay ho mein ne kaha ke mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke chachazaad bhai ki madad karna chahta hun Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Ahnaf ! tum laut jao kyunke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jab do Musalman apni talwaar le kar larein to maarnay wala aur maara janay wala donon jahannami hain mein ne arz kiya ke ya kisi aur ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! qaatil to jahannam mein jaye ga lekin maqtool kyun jaye ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo bhi to apne saathi ke qatl ka irada rakhta tha "
"2006","[AI-translation] ´Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ammar (raziyallahu anhu) ko aik baaghi giroh qatl karay ga "
"2007","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke (Musalmanon ke) do baray baray giroh larein ge aur un mein bari sakht larai ho gi aur donon ka daawa aik ho ga (yani donon ka deen aik ho ga aur donon ye daawa karein ge ke ham Allah ke deen ke liye lartay hain) "
"2008","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ! duniya fana na ho gi yahan tak ke aadmi qabr par guzray ga phir us par laitay ga aur kahay ga ke Kaash ! mein us qabr wala hota aur deen us ke liye aazmaish bin jaye ga "
"2009","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke harj bohat ho ga logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! harj kiya hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qatl qatl (yani khoon bohat hun ge) "
"2010","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mujhe us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ! duniya us waqt tak khatm na ho gi jab tak ke logon par aisa waqt na aa jaye ke jis mein qaatil ko ye tak maloom na ho ga ke wo qatl kyun kar raha hai aur maqtool ko bhi na maloom ho ga ke wo kyun qatl kiya ja raha hai logon ne kaha ke ye kaisay ho ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kusht o khoon ho ga qaatil aur maqtool donon jahannami hain "
"2011","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke aik aag Hijaaz ke mulk se niklay gi aur wo Basra ke oonton ki gardanon ko roshan kar de gi (yani us ki roshani aisi taiz ho gi ke Arab se shaam tak pahunche gi Hijaaz Makka aur Madina ka mulk aur Basra sheher ka naam hai)"
"2012","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke Daus ki auraton ki sireenein Zi ul khulasa ke gird hilein gi gi (yani wo us ka tawaaf karein gi) aur Zul Khalasa aik but tha jis ko Daus jahiliyat ke zamana mein Tabaala (Yaman ki aik jagah) mein pooja kartay thay "
"2013","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke raat aur din us waqt tak khatm na hun ge jab tak Laat aur Uzza (jahiliyat ke but) phir na poojay jayein ge mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein to samajhti thi ke jab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ” Allah wo hai jis ne apne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko hidayat aur sacha deen de kar bheja taake us ko sab deenon par ghalib karay agarchay mushrik log bura manein “ ke ye waada poora honay wala hai (aur Islam ke siwa aur koi deen ghalib na rahay ga) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab tak Allah Taala ko manzoor ho ga aisa hi ho ga phir Allah Taala aik pakeeza hua bhejay ga ke jis se har momin mar jaye ga yahan tak ke har wo shakhs bhi jis ke dil mein daanay ke barabar bhi iman hai aur wo log baaqi reh jayein ge jin mein bhalayi nahi ho gi phir wo log apne (mushrik) baap dada ke deen par laut jayein ge "
"2014","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kiya tum ne aisay sheher ke mutaliq suna hai jis ke aik jaanib khushki aur aik jaanib samandar hai sahaba ne kaha ke haan Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham ne suna hai (yani Qustuntuniya hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke us sheher se Ishaaq alaihissalam ki aulad mein se satr hazaar log larein ge pas jab us sheher ke paas aayein ge to utar parein ge bas hathiyar se larein ge na teer maarein ge balke ((la ilaah illa Allah wallahu a'lam Akbar)) kahein ge to us ki darya wali taraf gir paray gi phir doosri baar ((la ilaah illa Allah wallahu a'lam Akbar)) kahein ge to us ki doosri taraf gir paray gi phir teesri baar ((la ilaah illa Allah wallahu a'lam Akbar)) kahein ge to har taraf se khul jaye ga pas wo us sheher mein ghus parein ge aur maal ghaneemat lautein ge jab wo maal ghaneemat ko baant rahay hun ge ke achanak aik pukaarnay wala aa kar pukaaray ga ke Dajjal nikal aaya hai to wo har cheez ko chhor kar (Dajjal ki taraf) laut aayein ge "
"2015","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke Furaat mein sonay ka aik pahar niklay ga aur log us ke liye larein ge to har sainkray mein se ninanway maarein jayein ge aur har shakhs (apne dil mein) ye kahay ga ke shayad mein bach jaun "
"2016","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qareeb hai ke Furaat mein se sonay ka aik khazana niklay sau jo koi wahan maujood ho to wo us mein se kuch na le "
"2017","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum log qayamat ke qareeb aisay logon se laro ge jin ke jootay baalon ke hun ge aur un ke munh goya chauri dhaalein hain un ke chehray surkh aur aankhein choti hain "
"2018","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke (qabeela Qahtaan ka) aik shakhs niklay ga jo logon ko apni lakri se haan ke ga "
"2019","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : din aur raat khatm na hun ge yahan tak ke aik shakhs baadshah ho ga jis ko Jahjaah kahein ge "
