"2021","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala resham se zyada narm hua Yaman se bhejay ga jo kisi aisay aadmi ko na chhoray gi jis mein zarra barabar iman ho ga magar us ka maut aa jaye gi "
"2022","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat badtareen logon par qaim ho gi "
"2023","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke tees ke qareeb jhootay Dajjal paida na hun (Dajjal yani makkaar farebi hain) aur har aik ye kahay ga ke mein Allah ka Rasool hun "
"2024","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke qayamat se pehle jhootay paida hun ge aik riwayat mein hai ke Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne ye bhi kaha ke pas un se daro "
"2025","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke Musalman Yahud se larein ge phir Musalman un ko qatl karein ge hatta ke Yahudi kisi pathar ya darakht ki aar mein chhupe ga to wo pathar ya darakht bolay ga ke Ae Musalman ! Ae Allah ke banday ! ye mere peechay aik Yahudi hai idhar aa aur us ko qatl kar de magar Gharqad ka darakht na bolay ga (wo aik kaantay daar darakht hai jo bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf bohat zyada hota hai) wo Yahud ka darakht hai "
"2026","[AI-translation] ´Musa bin Ali apne baap se riwayat kartay hain ke` Mustaurid Qurashi raziyallahu anhu ne Amr bin Aas raziyallahu anhu ke saamnay kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke qayamat us waqt qaim ho gi jab Nasaara sab logon se zyada hun ge (yani Hindu aur Musalmanon se) Amr raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke dekh to kiya kehta hai Mustaurid raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein to wohi kehta hun jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai Amr raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke agar to kehta hai (to sach hai) to ye us liye hai ke Nasaara mein chaar khaslatein hain wo museebat ke waqt nihayat hausla walay hain museebat ke baad sab se jaldi hoshiyaar hotay hain bhaagnay ke baad sab se pehle phir hamla kartay hain aur sab logon mein miskeen yateem aur zaeef ke liye behtar hain aur aik paanchwin khaslat bhi hai jo nihayat umda hai ke wo badshahon ke zulm ko zyada roknay walay hain "
"2027","[AI-translation] ´Yaseer bin Jabir se riwayat hai ke` aik baar Kufa mein surkh aandhi aayi to aik shakhs aaya jis ka takiya kalaam hi ye tha ke Ae Abdullah bin Mas'ud ! qayamat aayi ye sun kar Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) baith gaye aur pehle wo takiya lagao hue thay aur kaha ke qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke tarka na battay ga aur maal ghaneemat se khushi na ho gi (kyunke jab koi waris hi na rahay ga to tarka kaun baante ga aur jab koi larai se zinda na bachay ga to maal ghaneemat ki kiya khushi ho gi) phir apne haath se shaam ke mulk ki taraf ishara kiya aur kaha ke dushman (Nasaara) Musalmanon se larnay ke liye jama hun ge aur Musalman bhi un se larnay ke liye jama hun ge mein ne kaha ke dushman se tumhari muraad Nasaara hain unhon ne kaha ke haan aur us waqt sakht larai shuru ho gi Musalman aik lashkar ko aagay bhejein ge jo marnay ke liye aagay barhe ga aur baghair ghalba ke na lautay ga (yani us qasd se jaye ga ke ya lar kar mar jayein ge ya fatah kar ke aayein ge) phir donon farqe larein ge yahan tak ke (larai mein) raat haayil ho jaye gi pas donon taraf ki faujein laut jayein gi aur kisi ko ghalba na ho ga aur larai ke liye barhnay wala lashkar bilkul fana ho jaye ga (yani us ke sab log qatl ho jayein ge) doosray din phir Musalman aik lashkar aagay badhayein ge jo marnay ke liye ya ghalib honay ke liye jaye ga aur larai rahay gi yahan tak ke raat haayil ho jaye gi phir donon taraf ki faujein laut jayein gi aur kisi ko ghalba na ho ga aur aagay barhnay wala lashkar bilkul fana ho jaye ga phir teesray din Musalman aik lashkar marnay ya ghalib honay ki niyyat se aagay badhayein ge aur shaam tak larai rahay gi phir donon taraf ki faujein laut jayein gi kisi ko ghalba na ho ga aur wo lashkar fana ho jaye ga jab chautha din ho ga to jitnay Musalman baaqi reh gaye hun ge wo sab aagay barhein ge aur us din Allah Taala kafiron ko shikast de ga aur aisi larai ho gi ke waisi koi na dekhay ga ya waisi larai kisi ne nahi dekhi ho gi yahan tak ke parinda un ke upar ya un ke badan par uray ga phir aagay nahi barhe ga ke wo murda ho kar gir jayein ga aik jadi log jo ginti mein sau hun ge un mein se aik shakhs bachay ga (yani ninanway feesad aadmi maaray jayein ge aur aik baaqi reh jaye ga) aisi haalat mein maal ghaneemat ki kaun si khushi hasil ho gi aur kaun sa tarka baanta jaye ga phir Musalman usi haalat mein hun ge ke aik aur bari aafat ki khabar sunein ge aik pukaar un ko aaye gi ke un ke peechay un ke baal bachon mein (kana) Dajjal aa chuka hai ye suntay hi jo kuch un ke haathon mein ho ga us ko chhor kar rawana hun ge aur das sawaaron ko jaasoosi ke taur par rawana karein ge (Dajjal ki khabar lanay ke liye) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein un sawaaron aur un ke baapon ke naam tak janta hun aur un ke ghoron ke rang bhi janta hun aur wo us din saari zameen ke behtar sawaar hun ge ya us din behtar sawaaron mein se hun ge "
"2028","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura raziyallahu anhu Nafi bin Utba raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kartay hain ke` unhon ne kaha ham aik jihad mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas kuch log Maghrib ki taraf se aaye jo oon ke kapray pehnay hue thay wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aik teelay ke paas aa kar milay wo log kharay thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baithay hue thay mere dil ne kaha ke to chal aur un logon aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke darmiyan mein ja kar khara ho aisa na ho ke ye log fareb se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko maar daalein phir mere dil ne kaha ke shayad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chupkay se kuch baatein un se kartay hun (aur mera jana Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko nagawar guzray) phir mein gaya aur un logon ke aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke darmiyan mein khara ho gaya pas mein ne us waqt Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se chaar baatein yaad kein jin ko mein apne haath par ginta hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum pehle to Arab ke jazeera mein (kafiron se) jihad karo ge Allah Taala us ko fatah kar de ga phir Faris (Iran) se jihad karo ge Allah Taala us par bhi fatah kar de ga phir Nasaara se laro ge Room walon se Allah Taala Room ko bhi fatah kar de ga phir Dajjal se laro ge aur Allah Taala us ko bhi fatah kar de ga (ye hadees Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka bara muajiza hai) Nafi ne kaha ke Ae Jabir bin Samura ! ham samajhtay hain ke Dajjal Room fatah honay ke baad hi niklay ga "
"2029","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat qaim na ho gi yahan tak ke Room ke Nasaara ka lashkar A'maaq mein ya Daabiq mein utray ga (ye donon muqaam shaam mein hain Halab ke qareeb) phir Madina se aik lashkar un ki taraf niklay ga jo un dinon tamam zameen walon mein behtar ho ga jab donon lashkar saf baandhein ge to Nasaara kahein ge ke tum un logon (yani Musalmanon) se alag ho jao jinhon ne hamari biwiyan aur larkay pakare aur londi ghulam binaye hain ham un se larein ge Musalman kahein ge ke nahi Allah ki qasam ! ham kabhi apne bhaiyon se na alag hun ge phir larai ho gi to Musalmanon ka aik tihayi lashkar bhaag niklay ga un ki tauba Allah Taala kabhi qabool na karay ga aur tihayi lashkar maara jaye ga wo Allah ke paas sab shaheedon mein afzal hun ge aur tihayi lashkar ki fatah ho gi wo Umar bhar kabhi fitnay aur bila mein na parein ge phir wo Qustuntuniya (Istanbool) ko fatah karein ge (jo Nasaara ke qabza mein aa gaya ho ga ab tak ye sheher Musalmanon ke qabza mein hai) wo apni talwarein zaitoon ke darakhton se latka kar maal ghaneemat baant rahay hun ge ke shaitaan ye pukaar lagao ga ke tumharay peechay tumharay gharon mein Dajjal ka zuhoor ho chuka hai pas Musalman wahan se niklein ge halanke ye khabar jhoot ho gi jab shaam ke mulk mein pahunchein ge to tab Dajjal niklay ga pas jis waqt Musalman larai ke liye mustaed ho kar safein baandhtay hun ge ke namaz ka waqt ho ga usi waqt Isa bin Maryam alaihima salaah wassalam utarein ge aur Imam bin kar namaz padhayein ge phir jab Allah Taala ka dushman Dajjal Isa alaihissalam ko dekhay ga to us tarah darr se ghul jaye ga jaisay namak pani mein ghul jata hai aur jo Isa alaihissalam us ko yunhi chhor dein tab bhi wo khud bakhud ghul kar halaak ho jaye lekin Allah Taala us ko Isa alaihissalam ke haathon se qatl karaye ga aur logon ko us ka khoon Isa alaihissalam ki barchhi mein dikhlaaye ga "
"2030","[AI-translation] ´Ubaidullah bin Qibtiya se riwayat hai ke` Haris bin Rabia aur Abdullah bin Safwan donon Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaye mein bhi un ke saath tha unhon ne Umm Salama raziyallahu anha se us lashkar ke baaray mein poocha jo dhans jaye ga aur ye us zamana ka zikr hai jab Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu Makka ke haakim thay unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya aik panah lenay wala khana Kaaba ki panah le ga (muraad Mahdi alaihissalam hain) to us ki taraf lashkar bheja jaye ga wo jab aik maidaan mein pahunch jayein ge to dhans jayein ge mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! jo shakhs zabardasti us lashkar ke saath ho (dil mein bura jaan kar) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo bhi un ke saath dhans jaye ga lekin qayamat ke din apni niyyat par uthay ga Abu Jafar ne kaha ke muraad Madina ka maidaan hai "
"2031","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : (qayamat ke qareeb Madina ke ghar) Ihaab ya Yahaab tak pahunch jayein ge Zuhair ne kaha ke mein ne Suhail se kaha ke Ihaab Madina se kitnay faaslay par hai unhon ne kaha ke itnay meel par (yani kaafi meel door hai) "
"2032","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Kaaba ko Habsha ka choti choti pindlion wala aik shakhs kharaab karay ga (muraad Abu Seeniya ke kafir hain jo Nasaara hain ya wast Habsh ke but parast aakhir zamana mein un ka ghalba ho ga aur jab Musalman duniya se uth jayein ge to ye mardood Habshi aisa kaam karay ga)"
"2033","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Iraq ka mulk apne dirham aur qafeez ko rokay ga shaam ka mulk apne muddi aur deenaar ko rokay ga aur Misr ka mulk apne ardab aur deenaar ko rokay ga aur tum aisay ho jao ge jaisay pehle thay aur tum aisay ho jao ge jaisay pehle thay aur tum aisay ho jao ge jaisay pehle thay phir Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us hadees par Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ka gosht aur khoon gawahi deta hai (yani us mein kuch shak nahi) "
"2034","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qaht ye nahi hai ke barish na barase balke qaht ye hai ke barish barase aur khoob barase lekin zameen se kuch na uge "
"2035","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne (amanat ke baab mein) do hadeesein bayan kein aik ko to mein dekh chuka aur doosri (ke poora honay) ka muntazir hun (pehli hadees ye hai ke) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham se bayan kiya ke amanat logon ke dilon ki jar par naazil phir Quran naazil hua pas unhon ne Quran ko hasil kiya aur hadees ko hasil kiya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham se (doosri) hadees bayan farmayi ke amanat uth jaye gi to farmaya ke aik shakhs thori dair sauye ga phir us ke dil se amanat utha li jaye gi aur us ka nishan aik pheekay rang ki tarah reh jaye ga phir aik neend karay ga to amanat dil se uth jaye gi aur us ka nishan aik chhaale ki tarah reh jaye ga jaisay to aik angara apne paon par larhka de phir khaal phool kar aik chhaala (aabla) nikal aaye ke tum us ko buland ubhra hua dekhtay ho magar us mein kuch nahi phir Aap ne aik kankari le kar apne paon par larhkayi aur farmaya ke log khareed o farokht karein ge aur un mein se koi aisa na ho ga jo amanat ko ada karay yahan tak ke log kahein ge ke falan qaum mein aik shakhs amanat daar hai aur yahan tak ke aik shakhs ko kahein ge wo kaisa hoshiyaar khush mizaaj aur aqalmand hai (yani us ki tareef karein ge) aur us ke dil mein raayi ke daanay barabar bhi iman na ho ga phir Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mere upar aik door guzar chuka hai jab mein baghair kisi darr ke har aik se muamla (yani lain deen) karta tha us liye ke agar wo Musalman hota to us ka deen us ko be-imaani se baaz rakhta aur jo Nasraani ya Yahudi hota to haakim us ko be-imaani se baaz rakhta tha lekin aaj ke din to mein tum logon se kabhi muamla na karun ga albatta falan aur falan shakhs se (muamla) karun ga "
"2036","[AI-translation] ´Abu Nazra se riwayat hai ke` ham Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas thay ke unhon ne kaha ke qareeb hai ke Iraq walon ke qafeez aur dirham nahi aayein ge ham ne kaha ke kis sabab se unhon ne kaha ke Ajam ke log us ko rok lein ge phir kaha ke qareeb hai ke shaam walon ke paas deenaar aur muddi na aayein (muddi aik paimaana hai usi tarah qafeez) ham ne kaha ke kis sabab se unhon ne kaha ke Room walay log rok lein ge phir thori dair chup rahay us ke baad kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke meri aakhir ummat mein aik khaleefa ho ga jo lapein bharbhar kar maal de ga (yani rupiya aur ashrafiaan logon ko) aur us ko shumaar na karay ga Jarir ne kaha ke mein ne Abu Nazra aur Abu Ala se poocha ke kiya tum samajhtay ho ke ye khaleefa Umar bin Abdul Aziz rahimahullah Allah hain unhon ne kaha ke nahi (ye Mahdi hain jo ummat ke aakhir zamana mein paida hun ge Umar bin Abdul Aziz rahimahullah Allah to shuru mein thay) "
"2037","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa bin Usaid Ghaffari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamaray paas aaye aur ham baatein kar rahay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum kiya baatein kar rahay ho ham ne kaha ke qayamat ka zikr kartay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qayamat qaim na ho gi jab tak ke das nishaniaan us se pehle nahi dekh lo ge phir zikr kiya dhuwein ka Dajjal ka zameen ke janwar ka sooraj ke Maghrib se nikalnay ka Isa alaihissalam ke utarnay ka Yajooj Majooj ke nikalnay ka teen jagah khasf ka yani zameen ka dhansna aik mashriq mein doosray Maghrib mein teesray jazeera Arab mein aur un sab nishaniyon ke baad aik aag paida ho gi jo Yaman se niklay gi aur logon ko haankti hui mehshar ki taraf le jaye gi (mehshar shaam ki zameen hai)"
"2038","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jaldi jaldi naik kaam kar lo un fitnon se pehle jo andheri raat ke hisson ki tarah hun ge subah ko aadmi imandaar ho ga aur shaam ko kafir ya shaam ko imandaar ho ga aur subah ko kafir ho ga aur apne deen ko duniya ke maal ke badlay baich daalay ga "
"2039","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : naik aamaal ke karnay mein chhe cheezon se pehle jaldi karo aik Dajjal doosray dhoaan teesray zameen ka janwar chauthay sooraj ka Maghrib se nikalna paanchwin qayamat aur chhatay maut "
"2040","[AI-translation] ´Mi'qal bin Yasar raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : fasaad aur fitnay ke waqt ibadat karnay ka itna sawab hai jaisay mere paas hijrat karnay ka "
"2041","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` ham Hajj ya Umra ko niklay aur hamaray saath bin Saaid bhi tha aik manzil mein ham utray log idhar idhar chalay gaye aur mein aur bin Saaid donon reh gaye mujhe us wajah se us se sakht weheshat hui ke log us ke baaray mein jo kaha kartay thay (ke Dajjal hai) bin Saaid apna asbaab le kar aaya aur mere asbaab ke saath rakh diya (mujhe aur zyada weheshat hui) mein ne kaha ke garmi bohat hai agar to apna asbaab us darakht ke neechay rakhay to behtar hai us ne aisa hi kiya phir hamein bakriyan dikhayi dein bin Saaid gaya aur doodh le kar aaya aur kehnay laga ke Abu Sa'eed ! doodh pi mein ne kaha ke garmi bohat hai aur doodh garam hai aur doodh na peenay ki us ke siwa koi wajah na thi ke mujhe us ke haath se pina bura maloom hua bin Saaid ne kaha ke Ae Abu Sa'eed ! mein ne qasd kiya hai ke aik rassi lun aur darakht mein latka kar apne Aap ko phaansi de lun un baaton ki wajah se jo log mere haq mein kehtay hain Ae Abu Sa'eed ! Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hadees itni kis se posheeda hai jitni tum Ansaar ke logon se posheeda hai kiya tum sab logon se zyada Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hadees ko nahi jantay kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne nahi farmaya ke Dajjal kafir ho ga aur mein to Musalman hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye nahi farmaya ke Dajjal laawalad ho ga aur meri aulad Madina mein maujood hai kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye nahi farmaya ke Dajjal Madina mein aur Makka mein na jaye ga aur mein Madina se aa raha hun aur Makka ko ja raha hun Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke (us ki aisi baaton ki wajah se) qareeb tha ke mein us ka tarafdaar bin jaun (aur logon ka us ke baaray mein kehna ghalat samajhon) ke phir kehnay laga albatta Allah ki qasam ! mein Dajjal ko pehchanta hun aur us ke paidaayish ka muqaam janta hun aur ye bhi janta hun ke ab wo kahan hai mein ne us se kaha ke kharaabi ho teri saara din (yani ye to ne kiya kaha ke phir mujhe teri nisbat shubha ho gaya) "
"2042","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` bin Sayyaad ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke jannat ki mitti kaisi hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke safed khaalis mushk ki tarah khushboodaar "
"2043","[AI-translation] ´Muhammad bin Munkadar se riwayat hai ke` mein ne Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ko (us par) qasam khatay hue dekha ke bin Saaid Dajjal hai mein ne kaha ke tum Allah ki qasam khatay ho unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Umar raziyallahu anhu ko dekha ke wo us baat par Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay qasam khatay hue suna aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ka inkar na kiya "
"2044","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Umar raziyallahu anhu Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath chand logon mein bin Sayyaad ke paas gaye hatta ke usay Bani Mughala ke qilay ke paas larkon ke saath kheltay hue dekha un dinon bin Sayyaad jawani ke qareeb tha us ko khabar na hui yahan tak ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ki peeth par apna haath maara phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se poocha ke kiya to us baat ki gawahi deta hai ke mein Allah Taala ka Rasool hun bin Sayyaad ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf dekha aur kaha ke mein gawahi deta hun ke tum ummiyeen ke Rasool ho (Ummi kehtay hain un padh aur be taleem ko) phir bin Sayyaad ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaha ke tum us baat ki gawahi detay ho ke mein Allah Taala ka Rasool hun Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us baat ka kuch jawab na diya (aur us se Musalman honay ki darkhwast na ki kyunke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ke Musalman honay se maayoos ho gaye aur aik riwayat mein Saad muhmala se yani Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko Laat se maara) aur farmaya ke mein Allah par aur us ke Rasoolullahon par iman laya phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se poocha ke tujhe kiya dikhayi deta hai wo bola ke mere paas kabhi sacha aata hai aur kabhi jhoota Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tera kaam garbar ho gaya (yani makhloot haq o baatil donon se) phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein ne tujh se poochnay ke liye aik baat dil mein chhupayi hai bin Sayyaad ne kaha ke wo Dakh (dhoaan) hai Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke zaleel ho to apni qadar se kahan barh sakta hai Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mujhe chhoryie mein us ki gardan maarta hun Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar ye wohi (yani Dajjal) hai to to us ko maar na sakay ga aur agar ye wo (Dajjal) nahi hai to tujhe us ka maarna behtar nahi hai Salim bin Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein ne Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se suna ke us ke baad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur bin Abu bin Ka'b raziyallahu anhu us baagh mein gaye jahan bin Sayyaad rehta tha jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baagh mein ghuse to khajoor ke darakhton ki aar mein chhupnay lagay taake Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bin Sayyaad ko dhoka de kar aur us ki kuch baatein sun sakein us se pehle ke bin Sayyaad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekhay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bin Sayyaad ko dekha ke wo aik bichhonay par laita hua tha aur kuch naafahm baatein gungna raha tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khajoor ke darakhton mein chhup rahay thay ke us ki maan ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekh kar usay pukara ke Ae saaf ! (aur saaf bin Sayyaad ka naam tha) ye Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aan pahunche ye suntay hi bin Sayyaad uth khara hua Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar wo us ko aisa hi rehnay deti to us ka muamla waazeh ho jata (to ham us ki baatein suntay to maloom kartay ke wo kaahin hai ya saahir) Salim ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam logon ke darmiyan kharay hue aur Allah Taala ki tareef ki jaisay us ko laiq hai phir Dajjal ka zikr kiya aur farmaya ke mein tumhein us se darata hun aur koi Nabi aisa nahi guzra jis ne apni qaum ko Dajjal se na darraya ho yahan tak ke Nooh alaihissalam ne bhi (jin ka door bohat pehle tha) apni qaum ko us se darraya lekin mein tum ko aisi baat batlaye deta hun jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum ko nahi batlayi tum jaan lo ke wo kana ho ga aur tumhara Allah barkat wala buland kana nahi hai (maazAllah kaanapan aik aib hai aur Allah Taala har aik aib se paak hai) bin Shihab ne kaha ke mujh se Umar bin saabit Ansari ne bayan kiya aur un se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baaz ashaab ne bayan kiya ke jis roz Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne logon ko Dajjal se darraya tha ye bhi farmaya ke us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan mein kafir likha ho ga (yani haqiqatan ka fa ra ye huroof likhe hun ge ya us ke chehray se kufr aur shararat numaayaan ho gi) jis ko har wo shakhs padh le ga jo us ke kaamon ko bura janay ga ya us ko har aik momin padh le ga aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum ye jaan rakho ke tum mein se koi bhi apne Rab ko marnay se pehle hargiz nahi dekh sakta "
"2045","[AI-translation] ´Nafi se riwayat hai ke` Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay thay ke mein bin Sayyaad se do baar mila hun aik baar mila to mein ne logon se kaha ke tum kehtay thay ke bin Sayyaad Dajjal hai unhon ne kaha ke nahi Allah ki qasam mein ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! tum ne mujhe jhoota kiya tum mein se baaz logon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke wo nahi maray ga yahan tak ke tum sab mein zyada maaldaar aur saahib aulad ho ga to wo aaj ke din aisa hi hai wo kehtay hain phir bin Sayyaad ne ham se baatein kein phir mein bin Sayyaad se juda hua kehtay hain ke jab dobara mila to us ki aankh phooli hui thi mein ne kaha ke ye teri aankh kab se aisay hai jo mein dekh raha hun wo bola ke mujhe maloom nahi mein ne kaha ke aankh tere sar mein hai aur tujhe maloom nahi wo bola ke agar Allah chahay to teri us lakri mein aankh paida kar de phir aisi aawaz nikaali jaisay gadha zor se karta hai Nafi ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar Umm ul-Momineen (Hafsa raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaye aur un se ye haal bayan kiya to unhon ne kaha ke bin Sayyaad se tera kiya kaam tha kiya to nahi janta ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke awwal cheez jo Dajjal ko logon par bhejay gi wo us ka ghussa hai (yani ghussa us ko nikalay ga) "
"2046","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein khoob janta hun ke Dajjal ke saath kiya ho ga us ke saath bati hui do neherein hun gi aik to dekhnay mein safed pani maloom ho gi aur doosri dekhnay mein bharakti hui aag maloom ho gi phir jo koi ye mauqa paye wo us neher mein chala jaye jo dekhnay mein aag maloom hoti hai aur apni aankh band kar le aur sar jhuka kar us mein se piye wo thanda pani ho ga aur Dajjal ki aik aankh bilkul chat ho gi us par aik moti phali ho gi aur us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan mein kafir likha ho ga jis ko har momin padh le ga khwah wo likhna janta ho ya na janta ho "
"2047","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Dajjal baayein aankh ka kana ho ga ghanay baalon wala ho ga us ke saath baagh ho ga aur aag ho gi pas us ki aag to baagh hai aur us ka baagh aag hai (ulama ne kaha ke ye bhi Allah Taala ki apne bandon ke liye aik aazmaish hai taake haq ko haq kar de aur jhoot ko jhoot phir us ko ruswa karay aur logon mein us ki aajizi zaahir karay) "
"2048","[AI-translation] ´Nawwaas bin Sam'aan raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik subah ko Dajjal ka zikr kiya to kabhi us ko ghataya aur kabhi barhaya (yani kabhi us ki tehqeer ki aur kabhi us ke fitna ko bara kaha ya kabhi buland aawaz se guftagu ki aur kabhi past aawaz se) yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kiya ke Dajjal khajoor ke darakhton ke jhand mein hai phir jab shaam ke waqt ham Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas gaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamaray chehron par us ka asar maloom kiya (yani darr aur khauf) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tumhara kiya haal hai ham ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya aur us ko ghataya aur barhaya yahan tak ke hamein gumaan ho gaya ke Dajjal un khajoor ke darakhton mein maujood hai (yani us ka aana bohat qareeb hai) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe Dajjal ke siwa aur baaton ka tum par khauf zyada hai (yani fitnon ka aur aapas ki laraion ka) agar Dajjal nikla aur mein tum logon mein maujood hua to tum se pehle mein us ka muqaabil hun ga (us se larai karun ga) aur tumhein us ke shar se bachaon ga aur agar wo nikla aur mein tum logon mein maujood na hua to har mard (Musalman) apni taraf se us se muqabla karay ga aur Allah Taala har Musalman par mera khaleefa aur nigehbaan ho ga albatta Dajjal to jawan ghunghryalay baalon wala hai us ki aankh ubhri hui hai goya ke mein us ki mushaabihat Abdul Uzza bin Qatan ke saath deta hun pas tum mein se jo shakhs Dajjal ko paye us ko chahiye ke Surah Kahf ki shuru ki aayaat us par padhay yaqeenan wo shaam aur Iraq ke darmiyan ki raah se niklay ga to apne daayein aur baayein haath fasaad phailaye ga Ae Allah ke bando ! iman par qaim rehna sahaba bolay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! wo zameen par kitni muddat rahay ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke chaalees din tak un mein se aik din aik saal ke barabar ho ga aik din aik maheena ke barabar aik din aik hafta ke barabar aur baaqi din jaisay ye tumharay din hain (to hamaray dinon ke hisab se Dajjal aik baras do maheena aur chaudah din tak rahay ga) sahaba ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! jo din saal bhar ke barabar ho ga us din hamein aik hi din ki namazein kifayat karay gi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke nahi tum us din mein (saal ki namazon ka) sahaba ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! us ki chaal zameen mein kaisi ho gi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us baadal ki tarah jis ko hua peechay se urati hai pas wo aik qaum ke paas aaye ga aur un ko dawat de ga wo us par iman laayein ge aur us ki baat manein ge pas wo aasmaan ko hukm karay ga to wo pani barasaye ga aur zameen ko hukm karay ga to wo ghaas aur anaaj uga de gi shaam ko un ke janwar aayein ge to un ke kohaan pehle se zyada lambay hun ge than kushaada hun ge aur kokhein tani hui (yani khoob moti ho kar) phir Dajjal doosri qaum ke paas aaye ga un ko bhi dawat de ga lekin wo us ki baat ko na manein ge to un ki taraf se hat jaye ga aur un par qaht saali aur khushki ho gi un ke haathon mein un ke maalon se kuch na rahay ga aur Dajjal veeraan zameen par niklay ga to us se kahay ga ke Ae zameen ! apne khazanay nikaal to wahan ke maal aur khazanay nikal kar us ke paas aisay jama ho jayein ge jaisay shehed ki makkhiaan sardar makkhi ke gird hujoom karti hain phir Dajjal aik jawan mard ko bulaye ga aur us ko talwaar maar kar do tukray kar daalay ga jaisay nishana do tok ho jata hai phir us ko zinda kar ke pukaaray ga pas wo jawan damaktay hue chehray ke saath hansta hua saamnay aaye ga sau Dajjal usi haal mein ho ga ke achanak Allah Taala Isa bin Maryam alaihimas salam ko bhejay ga Isa alaihissalam Dimashq ke sheher mein mashriq ki taraf safed meenaar ke paas utarein ge wo zard rang ka jora pehnay hue hun ge aur apne donon haath do farishton ke baazuon par rakhay hue hun ge jab Isa alaihissalam apna sar jhukaayein ge to paseena tapake ga aur jab apna sar uthayein ge to mauti ki tarah boondein baein gi jis kafir tak Isa alaihissalam ke dam ki khushbu pahunche gi wo mar jaye ga aur un ke dam ka asar wahan tak pahunche ga jahan tak un ki nazar pahunche gi phir Isa alaihissalam Dajjal ko talaash karein ge yahan tak ke us ko baab Ludd (naami pahar jo ke shaam mein hai) par maujood paa kar us ko qatl kar dein ge phir Isa alaihissalam ke paas wo log aayein ge jin ko Allah Taala ne Dajjal ke shar se bachaya ho ga pas wo shafqat se un ke chehron ko sehlaayein ge aur un ko un darjon ki khabar dein ge jo jannat mein un ke rakhay hain wo usi haal mein hun ge ke Allah Taala Isa alaihissalam par wahi bhejay ga ke mein ne apne aisay banday nikalay hain ke kisi ko un se larnay ki taqat nahi tum mere Musalman bandon ko taur (pahar) ki taraf panah mein le jao aur Allah Taala Yajooj aur Majooj ko bhejay ga aur wo har aik oonchaan se nikal parein ge un ke pehle log Tabaristaan ke darya par guzarein ge aur us ka saara pani pi lein ge phir un mein se pichlay log jab wahan aayein ge to kahein ge ke kabhi us darya mein pani bhi tha (phir chalein ge yahan tak ke us pahar tak pahunchein ge jahan darakhton ki kasrat hai yani bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ka pahar to wo kahein ge ke albatta ham zameen walon ko to qatl kar chukay ab aao aasmaan walon ko qatl karein to apne teer aasmaan ki taraf chalaayein ge Allah Taala un teeron ko khoon mein bhar kar lota de ga wo ye samajhein ge ke aasmaan ke log bhi maaray gaye ye mazmoon us riwayat mein nahi hai balke us ke baad ki riwayat se liya gaya hai) aur Allah Taala ke paighambar Isa alaihissalam aur un ke ashaab band rahein ge yahan tak ke un ke qareeb bail ka sar tumhari aaj ki sau ashrafi se afzal ho ga (yani khanay ki nihayat tangi ho gi) phir Allah ke paighambar Isa alaihissalam aur un ke saathi dua karein ge pas Allah Taala Yajooj aur Majooj ke logon par azaab bhejay ga to un ki gardanon mein keera paida ho ga to subah tak sab mar jayein ge jaisay aik aadmi marta hai phir Allah ke Rasoolullah Isa alaihissalam aur un ke saathi zameen par utarein ge to zameen mein aik baalisht barabar jagah un ki saraand aur gandagi se khaali na payein ge (yani tamam zameen par un ki sari hui laashein pari hun gi) phir Allah ke Rasoolullah Isa alaihissalam aur un ke saathi Allah se dua karein ge to Allah Taala baray oonton ki gardan ke barabar parinday bhejay ga wo un ko utha le jayein ge aur wahan phaink dein ge jahan Allah ka hukm ho ga phir Allah Taala aisa pani barasaye ga ke phir zameen ko hukm ho ga ke apne phal jama aur apni barkat ko pher de aur us din aik anaar ko aik giroh khaye ga aur us ke chhilkay ko bangla sa bana kar us ke saya mein baithein ge aur doodh mein barkat ho gi yahan tak ke doodh wali oontni aadmiyon ke baray giroh ko kifayat karay gi aur doodh wali gaaye aik baraadari ke logon ko kifayat karay gi aur doodh wali bakri aik pooray khaandaan ko kifayat karay gi pas log usi haalat mein hun ge ke yakayak Allah Taala aik paak hua bhejay ga wo un ki baghalon ke neechay lagay gi aur asar kar jaye gi to har momin aur Muslim ki rooh ko qabz karay gi aur buray badzaat log baaqi reh jayein ge gadhon ki tarah sareaam auraton se jima karein ge aur un par qayamat qaim ho gi "
"2049","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` ham se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Dajjal ke zikr mein aik lambi hadees bayan ki aur us mein ye bhi bayan kiya ke us par Madina ki ghaati mein ghusna haraam ho ga aur wo Madina ke qareeb aik pathreeli zameen par aaye ga phir us ke paas aik shakhs jaye ga jo sab logon mein behtar ho ga wo kahay ga ke mein gawahi deta hun ke to wohi Dajjal hai jis ka zikr janaab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni hadees mein kiya hai Dajjal logon se kahay ga ke bhala agar mein us ko maar daalun phir zinda kar dun to kiya tumhein us baaray mein kuch shak rahay ga wo kahein ge ke nahi Dajjal us shakhs ko qatl karay ga aur phir us ko zinda kar de ga pas jab wo us ko zinda karay ga to kahay ga ke Allah ki qasam ! mujhe pehle tere baaray mein itna yaqeen na tha jitna ab hai (yani ab to yaqeen ho gaya ke to Dajjal hai) phir Dajjal us ko qatl karna chahay ga lekin qatl na kar sakay ga rawi Ishaq ne kaha ke ye aadmi Khizr alaihissalam hain (lekin ye saabit nahi hai balke dalaayil us par shaahid hain ke Khizr alaihissalam wafaat paa chukay hain) "
"2050","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Dajjal niklay ga aur Musalmanon mein se aik shakhs us ki taraf chalay ga to rastay mein us ko Dajjal ke hathiyar band log milein ge wo us se poochein ge ke to kahan jata hai wo bolay ga ke mein usi shakhs ke paas jata hun jo nikla hai wo kahein ge ke to kiya hamaray Maalik par iman nahi laya wo kahay ga ke hamara Maalik chhupa nahi hai Dajjal ke log kahein ge ke us ko maar daalo phir aapas mein kahein ge ke hamaray Maalik ne to kisi ko maarnay se mana kiya hai jab tak us ke saamnay na le jayein phir us ko Dajjal ke paas le jayein ge jab wo Dajjal ko dekhay ga to kahay ga ke Ae logon ! ye wohi Dajjal hai jis ki khabar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne di thi Dajjal apne logon ko hukm de ga to us ke sar aur peeth aur pait par maara jaye ga phir wo kahay ga ke us ko pakro aur us ka sar phor do phir Dajjal us se poochay ga ke to mere upar (yani meri khudayi par) yaqeen nahi karta wo kahay ga ke to jhoota Masih hai phir Dajjal hukm de ga to wo aaray se sar se le kar donon paon tak cheera jaye ga yahan tak ke do tukray ho jaye ga phir Dajjal un donon tukron ke baich mein jaye ga aur kahay ga ke uth khara ho wo shakhs (zinda ho kar seedha) uth kar khara ho jaye ga phir us se poochay ga ke ab to mere upar iman laya wo kahay ga ke mujhe to aur zyada yaqeen hua ke to Dajjal hai phir logon se kahay ga ke Ae logon ! ab Dajjal mere siwa kisi aur se ye kaam na kar sakay ga (yani ab kisi ko jala nahi sakta) phir Dajjal us ko zabah karnay ke liye pakare ga to us ke galay se le kar hansli tak taanbay ka bin jaye ga aur wo usay zabah na kar sakay ga phir us ke haath paon pakar kar phaink de ga log samajhein ge ke us ko aag mein phaink diya halanke wo jannat mein daalnay jaye ga Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye shakhs sab logon mein Allah Rab Aalameen ke qareeb bara shaheed hai "
"2051","[AI-translation] ´Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kisi ne Dajjal ke baaray mein itna nahi poocha jitna mein ne poocha hatta ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to kyun fikr karta hai Dajjal tujhe nuqsan na pahunchaye ga mein ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! log kehtay hain ke us ke saath khana ho ga aur neherein hun gi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ho ga lekin Allah Taala par to us se zyada aasaan hai (Allah Taala us ko us se bhi zyada ikhtiyar de sakta hai us par kiya mushkil hai yani jo us ke paas ho ga wo us se mominon ko gumrah na kar sakay ga)"
"2052","[AI-translation] ´Numan bin Salim kehtay hain ke` mein ne Ya'qoob bin Aasim bin Urwa bin Mas'ud Saqafi se suna wo kehtay thay ke mein ne Abdullah bin Amr raziyallahu anhuma se suna aur un ke paas aik aadmi aaya aur kehnay laga ke ye hadees kiya hai jo tum bayan kartay ho ke qayamat itni muddat mein ho gi unhon ne (taajjub se) kaha ke SubhanAllah Allah ya la ilaah illa Allah ya usi tarah ka koi aur kalima kaha aur phir kehnay lagay ke mera khayal hai ke ab mein kisi se koi hadees bayan na karun (kyunke log kuch kehtay hain aur mujhe badnaam kartay hain) mein ne to ye kaha tha ke tum thoray dinon ke baad aik bara haadisa dekho ge jo ghar ko Jalaye ga aur wo zaroor ho ga phir kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke meri ummat mein Dajjal niklay ga aur chaalees tak rahay ga mein nahi janta ke chaalees din farmaya ya chaalees maheena ya chaalees baras phir Allah Taala Isa bin Maryam alaihimas salam ko bhejay ga aur un ki shakal o soorat Urwa bin Mas'ud ki si hai wo Dajjal ko dhoondhein ge aur us ko qatl karein ge phir saat baras tak log aisay rahein ge ke do aadmiyon mein koi dushmani na ho gi phir Allah Taala shaam ki taraf se aik thandi hua bhejay ga to zameen par koi aisa na rahay ga jis ke dil mein ratti barabar iman ya bhalayi ho magar ye hua us ki jaan nikaal le gi yahan tak ke agar koi tum mein se pahar ke kalaiji mein ghus jaye to wahan bhi ye hua pahunch kar us ki jaan nikaal le gi Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke phir buray log duniya mein reh jayein ge chariyon ki tarah jald baaz ya be aqal aur darindon ki tarah un ke akhlaaq hun ge na wo achi baat ko acha samajhein ge aur na buri baat ko bura phir shaitaan aik soorat bana kar un ke paas aaye ga aur kahay ga ke kiya tum meri baat ko qabool nahi kartay wo kahein ge ke phir to hamein kiya hukm deta hai shaitaan kahay ga ke but parasti karo wo but poojein ge aur us ke bawajood un ki rozi kushaada ho gi aur mazay se zindagi guzaarein ge phir soor phoonka jaye ga aur us ko koi na sunay ga magar aik taraf se gardan jhukaye ga aur doosri taraf se uthay ga (yani behosh ho kar gir paray ga) aur sab se pehle soor ko wo sunay ga jo apne oonton ke hauz ko laip raha ho ga wo behosh ho jaye ga aur doosray log bhi behosh ho jayein ge phir Allah Taala pani barasaye ga jo nutfa ki tarah ho ga us se logon ke badan ug aayein ge phir soor phoonka jaye ga to sab log kharay hue dekh rahay hun ge phir pukara jaye ga ke Ae logon ! apne Maalik ke paas aao ” aur un ko khara karo beshak un se sawal ho ga “ (as-Saaffaat : 24) phir kaha jaye ga ke aik lashkar ko dozakh ke liye nikaal lo poocha jaye ga ke kitnay log hukm ho ga ke har hazaar mein se no sau ninanway (aur har hazaar mein se aik jinti ho ga) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke yehi wo din hai jo bachon ko (haiyat aur museebat se ya lambii se) boorha kar de ga aur yehi wo din hai jab pindli khulay gi (yani sakhti ho gi ya Allah Taala qayamat ke din apni pindli zaahir karay ga jis se momin sajday mein gir jayein ge) "
"2053","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aik hadees yaad rakhi hai jis ko mein kabhi nahi bhoola mein ne suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke qayamat ki pehli nishaniyon mein se sooraj ka Maghrib ki taraf se nikalna hai aur chasht ke waqt logon par zameen ke janwar ka nikalna hai aur jo nishani un donon mein pehle ho gi to doosri bhi us ke baad jald hi zaahir ho gi "
"2054","[AI-translation] ´Amir bin Sharaaheel Sha'bi (Sha'b Hamdaan) se riwayat hai ` unhon ne Fatima bint Qais raziyallahu anha se jo ke Zahhaak bin Qais raziyallahu anhu ki behan thin aur un auraton mein se thin jinhon ne pehle hijrat ki thi kaha ke mujh se aik aisi hadees bayan karo jo tum ne Rasoolullah usay bilaawaasta suni ho wo bolein ke acha agar tum ye chahtay ho to mein bayan karun gi unhon ne kaha ke haan bayan karo Fatima raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke mein ne bin Mughira se nikah kiya aur wo un dinon Quraish ke umda jawanon mein se thay phir wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath pehle hi jihad mein shaheed ho gaye jab mein bewa ho gayi to mujhe Abdur Rahman bin Auf raziyallahu anhu ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahaba mein se chand ke saath aa kar nikah ka paigham diya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne maula Usama bin Zaid raziyallahu anhu ke liye paigham bheja aur mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ye hadees sun chuki thi ke jo shakhs mujh se mohabbat rakhay us ko chahiye ke Usama raziyallahu anhu se bhi mohabbat rakhay jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se us baaray mein guftagu ki to mein ne kaha ke mere kaam ka ikhtiyar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jis se chahein nikah kar dijiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum Umm shareek ke ghar chali jao aur Umm shareek Ansaar mein aik maaldaar aurat thi aur Allah ki raah mein bohat zyada kharch karti thin us ke paas mehmaan utartay thay mein ne arz kiya ke bohat acha mein Umm shareek ke paas chali jaun gi phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Umm shareek ke paas mat ja us ke paas mehmaan bohat aatay hain aur mujhe bura maloom hota hai ke kahein teri orhni gir jaye ya teri pindlion par se kapra hat jaye aur log tere badan mein se wo dekhein jo tujhe bura lagay ga tum apne chacha ke betay Abdullah bin Amr bin Umm Maktoom ke paas chali jao aur wo Bani Fihr mein se aik shakhs tha aur Fihr Quraish ki aik shaakh hai aur wo us qabeela mein se tha jis mein se Fatima raziyallahu anha bhi thin phir Fatima ne kaha ke mein un ke ghar mein chali gayi jab meri iddat guzar gayi to mein ne pukaarnay walay ki aawaz suni aur wo pukaarnay wala Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka munaadi tha wo pukaar raha tha ke namaz ke liye jama ho jao mein bhi masjid ki taraf nikli aur mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padhi mein us saf mein thi jis mein aurtein logon ke peechay thin jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne namaz padh li to mimbar par baithay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hans rahay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke har aik aadmi apni namaz ki jagah par rahay phir farmaya ke tum jantay ho ke mein ne tumhein kyun ikaththa kiya hai sahaba bolay ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob jantay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah ki qasam mein ne tumhein raghbat dilanay ya darranay ke liye jama nahi kiya balke us liye jama kiya ke Tameem daari aik Nasraani tha wo aaya aur us ne bai'at ki aur Musalman hua aur mujh se aik hadees bayan ki jo us hadees ke muwafiq hai jo mein tum se Dajjal ke baaray mein bayan kiya karta tha us ne bayan kiya ke wo yani Tameem samandar ke jahaaz mein tees aadmiyon ke saath sawaar hua jo Lakhm aur Jazaam ki qaum mein se thay pas un se aik maheena bhar samandar ki leherein khailti rahein phir wo log samandar mein doobtay sooraj ki taraf aik jazeeray ke kinaaray ja lagay pas wo jahaaz se palwaar (yani choti kashti) mein baithay aur jazeeray mein daakhil ho gaye wahan un ko aik janwar mila jo ke bhaari dam bohat baalon wala ke us ka agla pichla hissa baalon ke hujoom se maloom na hota tha logon ne us se kaha ke Ae kambakht to kiya cheez hai us ne kaha ke mein jaasoos hun logon ne kaha ke jaasoos kiya us ne kaha ke us mard ke paas challu jo dair mein hai ke wo tumhari khabar ka bohat mushtaaq hai Tameem raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke jab us ne mard ka naam liya to ham us janwar se darre ke kahein shaitaan na ho Tameem ne kaha ke phir ham daurtay hue (yani jaldi) dair mein daakhil hue dekha to wahan aik baray qad ka aadmi hai ke ham ne itna bara aadmi aur waisa sakht jakra hua kabhi nahi dekha us ke donon haath gardan ke saath bandhe hue thay aur donon zaanon se takhnon tak lohay se jakra hua tha ham ne kaha ke Ae kambakht ! to kiya cheez hai us ne kaha tum meri khabar par qaabu paa gaye ho (yani mera haal to tum ko ab maloom ho jaye ga) tum apna haal batao ke tum kaun ho logon ne kaha ke ham Arab log hain samandar mein jahaaz mein sawaar hue thay lekin jab ham sawaar hue to samandar ko josh mein paya phir aik maheena ki muddat tak leher ham se khailti rahi phir ham us jazeeray mein aa lagay to choti kashti mein baith kar jazeeray mein daakhil hue pas hamein aik bhaari dam ka aur bohat baalon wala janwar mila ham us ke baalon ki kasrat ki wajah se us ka agla pichla hissa na pehchantay thay ham ne us se kaha ke Ae kambakht ! to kiya cheez hai us ne kaha ke mein jaasoos hun ham ne kaha ke jaasoos kiya us ne kaha ke us mard ke paas challu jo dair mein hai aur wo tumhari khabar ka bohat mushtaaq hai pas ham teri taraf daurtay hue aaye aur ham us se darre ke kahein bhoot parait na ho phir us mard ne kaha ke mujhe Baisaan ke nakhlistaan ki khabar do ham ne kaha ke to us ka kaun sa haal poochta hai us ne kaha ke mein us ke nakhlistaan ke baaray mein poochta hun ke phalta hai ham ne us se kaha ke haan phalta hai us ne kaha ke khabardaar raho anqareeb wo na phale ga us ne kaha ke mujhe Tabaristaan ke darya ke baaray mein batlao ham ne kaha ke to us darya ka kaun sa haal poochta hai wo bola ke us mein pani hai logon ne kaha ke us mein bohat pani hai us ne kaha ke albatta us ka pani anqareeb khatm ho jaye ga phir us ne kaha ke mujhe Zaghar ke chashmay ke baaray mein khabar do logon ne kaha ke us ka kiya haal poochta hai us ne kaha ke us chashma mein pani hai aur wahan ke log us pani se khaiti kartay hain ham ne us se kaha ke haan ! us mein bohat pani hai aur wahan ke log us ke pani se khaiti kartay hain us ne kaha ke mujhe ummiyeen ke paighambar ke baaray mein khabar do ke wo kiya rahay logon ne kaha ke wo Makka se niklay hain aur Madina mein gaye hain us ne kaha ke kiya Arab ke log un se laray ham ne kaha ke haan us ne kaha ke unhon ne Arabon ke saath kiya kiya ham ne kaha ke wo apne gird o pesh ke Arabon par ghalib hue aur unhon ne un ki itaat ki us ne kaha ke ye baat ho chuki ham ne kaha ke haan us ne kaha ke khabardaar raho ye baat un ke haq mein behtar hai ke paighambar ke taabedaar hun aur albatta mein tum se apna haal kehta hun ke mein Masih (Dajjal) hun aur albatta wo zamana qareeb hai ke jab mujhe nikalnay ki ijazat ho gi pas mein nikalon ga aur sair karun ga aur kisi basti ko na chhoron ga jahan chaalees raat ke andar na jaun siwae Makka aur tayyiba ke ke wahan jana mujh par haraam hai yani mana hai jab mein un donon bastiyon mein se kisi ke andar jana chahun ga to mere aagay aik farishta barh aaye ga aur us ke haath mein nangi talwaar ho gi wo mujhe wahan janay se rok de ga aur albatta us ke har aik naaka par farishtay hun ge jo us ki chaukidaari karein ge Fatima raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni chhari mimbar par maar kar farmaya ke tayyiba yehi hai tayyiba yehi hai tayyiba yehi hai yani tayyiba se muraad Madina Munawwara hai khabardaar raho ! bhala mein tum ko us haal ki khabar de nahi chuka hun to ashaab ne kaha ke haan Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe Tameem raziyallahu anhu ki baat achi lagi jo us cheez ke muwafiq hui jo mein ne tum logon se Dajjal aur Madina aur Makka ke haal se farma diya tha khabardaar ho ke wo shaam ya Yaman ke samandar mein hai nahi balke wo mashriq ki taraf hai wo mashriq ki taraf hai wo mashriq ki taraf hai (mashriq ki taraf behr Hind hai shayad Dajjal behr Hind ke kisi jazeera mein ho) aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mashriq ki taraf ishara kiya Fatima bint Qais (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke ye hadees mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se yaad rakhi hai "
"2055","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : koi sheher aisa nahi hai jis mein Dajjal na aaye siwae Makka aur Madina ke aur koi rasta nahi ho ga magar farishtay un ke har rastay par saf baandhay kharay hun ge aur chaukidaari karein ge phir Dajjal (Madina ke qareeb) Sabkha muqaam par utray ga aur Madina teen baar kaanpay ga (yani teen baar us mein zalzala ho ga) aur jo us mein kafir ya munafiq ho ga wo nikal kar Dajjal ke paas chala jaye ga "
"2056","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Isfahaan ke satr hazaar Yahudi siyah chaadrein orhay hue Dajjal ki pairwi karein ge "
"2057","[AI-translation] ´Umm shareek raziyallahu anha se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke log Dajjal se (bachnay ke liye) paharon mein bhaag jayein ge Umm shareek raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Arab ke log us din kahan hun ge (yani wo Dajjal se muqabla kyun na karein ge) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Arab un dinon thoray hun ge (aur Dajjal ke saathi karoron) "
"2058","[AI-translation] ´Humaid bin Hilaal aik giroh se` jin mein Abu Dahma aur Qatada bhi shaamil thay se riwayat kartay hain ke unhon ne kaha ke ham Hisham bin Amir raziyallahu anhu ke saamnay Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas jaya kartay thay aik din Hisham raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tum aagay barh kar aisay logon ke paas jatay ho jo mujh se zyada Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas haazir nahi rehtay thay aur na Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hadees ko mujh se zyada jantay hain mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Adam alaihissalam ke waqt se lekar qayamat tak koi makhlooq (shar o fasaad mein) Dajjal se bari nahi hai (sab se zyada mufsid aur shareer Dajjal hai) "
"2059","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ” Allah ki qasam ! Maryam alaiha salam ke betay (aasmaan se) utarein ge aur wo haakim hun ge adl karein ge saleeb ko tor daalein ge aur khinzeer ko maar daalein ge aur jizya lena mauqoof kar dein ge aur jawan oont ko chhor diya jaye ga phir koi us par mehnat na karay ga aur logon ke dilon mein se bukhl dushmani aur hasad jatay rahein ge aur wo logon ko maal denay ke liye bulayein ge lekin koi qabool na karay ga (us wajah se ke haajat na ho gi aur maal kasrat se har aik ke paas ho ga) "
"2060","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tumhara kiya haal ho ga jab Maryam alaiha salam ke betay (aasmaan se) utarein ge phir tum logon mein se hi tumharay log imamat karein ge (rawi Waleed bin Muslim ne kaha) mein ne bin Abu Zi'b se kaha mujh se Auzaa'i ne hadees bayan ki Zuhri se unhon ne Nafi se aur unhon ne Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se us mein ye hai ke tumhara Imam tum hi mein se ho ga bin Abu Zi'b ne kaha to janta hai ke us ka matlab kiya hai ke tumhari imamat tumhi logon mein se karein ge mein ne kaha ke Aap hi batlaiye to unhon ne kaha Isa alaihissalam tumharay Rab ki kitab (yani Quran Majeed) aur tumharay paighambar ki sunnat se tumhari imamat karein ge "
"2061","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke qayamat tak meri ummat mein se aik giroh (kafiron aur mukhaalifon se) hamesha haq (baat) par larta rahay ga wo (giroh) ghalib rahay ga phir Isa bin Maryam alaihimas salam utarein ge aur us giroh ka Imam (Isa alaihissalam se) kahay ga ke aayie namaz padhayie wo kahein ge nahi tum mein se aik doosron par haakim rahein ye wo buzrugi hai jo Allah Taala us ummat ko inayat farmaye ga "
"2062","[AI-translation] ´Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni us ungli se ishara kartay thay jo angoothay aur darmiyan ki ungli se qareeb hai aur farmatay thay ke mein aur qayamat us tarah saath saath bhejay gaye hain"
"2063","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik aadmi ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se sawal kiya ke qayamat kab ho gi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam thori dair khamosh rahay phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us bachay ki taraf jo Azd Shanua mein se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay baitha hua tha dekh kar farmaya ke agar us bacha ki Umar lambi hui to ye boorha na ho ga yahan tak ke teri qayamat qaim ho jaye gi Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye larka us din mera ham Umar tha "
"2064","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` dehati jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aatay to qayamat ke baaray mein poochtay ke wo kab ho gi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un mein se kam Umar ko dekhtay aur farmatay ke agar ye jiye ga to boorha na ho ga yahan tak ke tumhari qayamat qaim ho jaye gi (kyunke tumhari qayamat yehi hai ke tum mar jao muraad qayamat sughra hai aur wo maut hai)"
"2065","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan kartay hue kehtay hain ke` qayamat qaim ho jaye gi aur mard oontni dohta ho ga pas bartan us ke munh tak na pahuncha ho ga ke qayamat aa jaye gi aur do mard kapray ki khareed o farokht kartay hun ge khareed o farokht na kar payein ge ke qayamat aa jaye gi aur koi mard apna hauz durust kar raha ho ga pas us ko durust kar ke na phira ho ga ke qayamat aa jaye gi "
"2066","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : soor ke donon phoonkon ke darmiyan mein chaalees ka faasla ho ga logon ne kaha ke Ae Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ! chaalees din ka unhon ne kaha ke mein nahi kehta phir logon ne kaha ke chaalees maheena ka unhon ne kaha ke mein nahi kehta phir logon ne kaha ke chaalees baras ka unhon ne kaha ke mein nahi kehta (yani mujhe us ka ta'ayyun maloom nahi hai) phir aasmaan se aik pani barase ga us se log aisay ug aayein ge jaisay sabza ug aata hai unhon ne kaha ke aadmi ke badan mein koi cheez aisi nahi jo gal na jaye magar aik haddi aur wo reerh ki haddi hai usi haddi se qayamat ke din log paida hun ge (Nawawi rahimahullah Allah ne kaha ke us mein se paighambar mustasna hain ke un ke jismon ko Allah Taala ne zameen par haraam kar diya hai)"
"2067","[AI-translation] ´Usama bin Zaid bin Harisa aur Sa'eed bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Rasoolullah usay riwayat kartay hue kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein ne apne baad mardon ko nuqsan pahunchanay wala auraton se zyada koi fitna nahi chhora (ye aksar khilaf shara kaam karati hain aur jo mard zan mureed hotay hain un ko majboor kar deti hain) "
"2068","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : duniya (zaahir mein) meethi aur sarsabz hai (jaisay taaza mewa) aur Allah Taala tumhein duniya mein haakim karnay wala hai phir dekhay ga ke tum kaisay amal kartay ho sau duniya se bacho (yani aisi duniya se jo Allah Taala se ghafil kar de) aur auraton se bacho us liye ke awwal fitna Bani Israil ka auraton se shuru hua "
